<title>FINLAND: TENNIS-GREECE LEAD FINLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GREECE LEAD FINLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Finland after the openng singles of their Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group two first round tie here on Friday:</p>
<p>Results (Finish names first):</p>
<p>Tuomas Ketola lost to Anastasios Vasiliadis 2-6 6-1 7-6 4-6 4-6</p>
<p>Kim Tiilikainen lost to Konstantinos Economidis 7-6 5-7 4-6 1-6</p>
</text>
